{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dungeon where torch-lit corridors weave like veins through stone and darkness, a hotpot stall offers a rare warmth amidst the cold and chaos. While adventurers clash to claim the dungeon\u2019s throne, you see another path: serving hot meals to weary fighters who share their tales of triumph, regret, and rivalry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, even the fiercest heroes find a moment\u2019s peace, escaping the struggle over a bowl of hotpot\u2014and sharing stories only a fellow adventurer would understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333380/extras/3735d9f03932736a2af24b864889e895.avif?t=1758805137\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333380/extras_big/3735d9f03932736a2af24b864889e895.avif?t=1758805137 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3333380?t=1758805137","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333380/7eed507a24e84ee9c725a184f8b80331caa677e7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758805137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333380/75bb7548143c1fc1c5d1b3cb97e1e39048daf897/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758805137","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333380/75bb7548143c1fc1c5d1b3cb97e1e39048daf897/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758805137","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a dungeon where torch-lit corridors weave like veins through stone and darkness, a hotpot stall offers a rare warmth amidst the cold and chaos. While adve